{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_3_2_2_2_12_BswMLinTpModeRequest","src":"manifest","doc":"EXP_ModeManagementGuide","page":27,"text":"3.2.2.2.12 BswMLinTpModeRequest\nPurpose:\nFunction called by LinTP to request a mode for the corresponding\nLIN channel. The LinTp_Mode mainly correlates to the LIN schedule\ntable that should be used.\nSignature:\nvoid BswM_LinTp_RequestMode(\nNetworkHandleType Network,\nLinTp_Mode LinTpRequestedMode\n)\nModes:\nmodeGroup LinTp_Mode\nExample:\nrequest LinTpModeRequest LinTp_Mode {\nprocessing IMMEDIATE\ninitialValue LINTP_APPLICATIVE_SCHEDULE\nsource MyLinIF.config0.LinIFChannel\n}","caption":"3.2.2.2.12 BswMLinTpModeRequest","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWM_SECTION_3_2_2_2_12_BswMLinTpModeRequest","releases":["R23-11"],"page":27,"hash":"9eb1b218e47819f9","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/8d045f4bd4af/page_27.webp"}],"releases":["R23-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/8d045f4bd4af/page_27.webp","trel":"R23-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R24-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"deterministic","why":"Cited verbatim in the snippet (deterministic citation).","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_BswM_00156"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"deterministic","why":"Cited verbatim in the snippet (deterministic citation).","rel":["R23-11"],"id":"SWS_COMTYPE_00038"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"LinTp_Mode enumeration definition","rel":[],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00629"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"CALLER_CONTRACT","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"LinIf calls BswM_LinTp_RequestMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00078"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"CALLER_CONTRACT","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"LinIf calls BswM_LinTp_RequestMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_LinIf_00614"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"CALLER_CONTRACT","m":"gemini-3.8-flas